Avec cette application, vous pouvez apprendre les panneaux routiers en forme de jeu. Notre quiz peut être utile pour les étudiants des auto-écoles qui se préparent à passer les examens pour le permis de conduire, ainsi que les chauffeurs experimentés qui veulent rafraichir le Code de la route dans leur mémoire.

Les avantages de l'application “Panneaux routiers: quiz sur le Code de la route”:

* Deux modes de jeu: quiz avec choix de réponse correcte et mode "Vrai / Faux";
* Possibilité de choisir les catégories des panneaux: on peut choisir les groupes necessaires pour s'entrainer et pour deviner exclusivement les panneaux de ces groupes;
* Deux niveaux de difficulté: le simulateur permet de choisir la quantité de réponses possibles – 4 ou 6. Ca permet de compliquer ou de simplifier le quiz selon vos besoins;
* Statistique après chaque jeu: le simulateur montre la quantité de réponses données et le pourcentage de bonnes réponses parmi les réponses données;
* Ensemble de panneaux routiers au dernier indice de revision de 2021;
* Répertoire complet de panneaux routiers de la France avec descriptions;
* Le fonctionnement de l'application n'exige pas d'accès a Internet;
* L'application est optimisée pour les téléphones ainsi que les tablettes;
* Interface simple et clair.

Creative and educational game for children that will help your child spend time with an electronic device effectively. Let your child feel like a real artist. The app includes coloring activity which is friendly to the youngest as well as drawing lessons intended to develop fine motor skills. Also, the app contains pictures on different topics which will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny characters. The following is waiting for you:

- 9 topic packs with 135 pages;
- Easy coloring for children;
- Drawing lessons;
- Creativity development.

The app is designed for children of preschool age and also suitable for boys and girls 2- 4 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational elements as developing of fine motor skills and logic. Have fun!

15 learning Games for kids (2-4 y.)
Keep your toddlers occupied with 15 different educational games, which will help them learn and improve their skills while having a great fun. 

Have you ever noticed how your toddler gets absorbed by an activity they enjoy? You might even wish they were as attentive to their homework or preschool as they are with games. 

They can't help it. Play is an integral part of development for 2,3,4-year-olds. But what we can do instead is to help them absorb valuable information through fun games. 

We combined 15 fun and educational baby games in one app to help you and your kids navigate through the assortment of activities and puzzles. 

Your toddlers & preschoolers will be able to:
 ► Identify shapes, sizes, and colors by playing toddler puzzles that let you sort objects;
 ► Learn about domestic and wild animals by taking care of them in our baby games;
 ► Learn about healthy food; 

You might even find yourself enjoying a few of these puzzles.. 

Our apps are developed and tested by child development experts. 

Safety and convenience. No supervision needed: 
 ► Parental Gate - Code protected sections so that your child doesn’t accidentally change settings or make unwanted purchases; 
 ► Offline - playable without an internet connection;
 ► Timely hints - so your child doesn't feel frustrated or lost in the app; 
 ► Ads free - no annoying interruptions.

App's 15 learning games provide safe and useful screen time for your 2-4 year old boys and girls.

Who says learning can't be fun?
